desc:
I am specifically looking for a verified current employee of Google, Amazon, Shopify, Meta, Microsoft, Uber, Airbnb, TikTok, or a comparable global technology company.

The ideal professional currently works as a recruiter, hiring manager, talent acquisition specialist, product leader, category/vendor manager, marketplace leader, business operations manager, or another employee involved in evaluating, interviewing, hiring, managing, or referring candidates.

This is not a general resume-writing project. I need someone with direct, current, and verifiable Big Tech experience who understands internal candidate evaluation and can help me build a competitive application profile.

TARGET ROLES

* Category Manager / Vendor Manager
* E-commerce Manager / Marketplace Manager
* AI Product Builder / Product Manager
* Product Operations
* Business Operations / Program Manager

MY BACKGROUND

I have more than seven years of hands-on e-commerce and marketplace experience across the United States, Germany, and the United Kingdom.

My experience includes:

* Private Label, Wholesale, Online Arbitrage, and Dropshipping;
* Product research and selection;
* Supplier sourcing, evaluation, communication, and negotiation;
* Pricing, margin, cost, and profitability analysis;
* Inventory, orders, fulfillment, returns, and customer issues;
* Coordinating international suppliers, preparation centers, fulfillment partners, and external collaborators;
* More than €100,000 in cumulative revenue generate
